    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Like building and survival \uff1f Buy this! We are going to build and survive in Backrooms!<br><br>The backrooms is a world of terror, danger, and charming, but none of these can stop people's thirst for benefits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/400b6f5bbe96a826e0f1ae9093557414.poster.avif?t=1749455662\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/400b6f5bbe96a826e0f1ae9093557414.webm?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/400b6f5bbe96a826e0f1ae9093557414.mp4?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Since Backrooms became known to the world, within a year, a large number of companies, groups, and wanderers have been seeking opportunities to enter the Backrooms, searching for treasures, occupying land, and obtaining huge profits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/68933bc5ba664ef3d358b669140e34b4.poster.avif?t=1749455662\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/68933bc5ba664ef3d358b669140e34b4.webm?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/68933bc5ba664ef3d358b669140e34b4.mp4?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The player is an individual wanderer, entering the back room through the emerging company - Wanderer Union Limited. In the midst of mystery and danger, they collect supplies, establish outposts, and earn profits!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/97b3fb2da9f8d02e5ceac7710d45108d.poster.avif?t=1749455662\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/97b3fb2da9f8d02e5ceac7710d45108d.webm?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/97b3fb2da9f8d02e5ceac7710d45108d.mp4?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game elements:<br><br>\u25a0 Free exploration! Explore and discover interesting things freely in the multi-layered open world of the backrooms!<br><br>\u25a0 Collect materials! There are many interesting garbage and treasures in the backrooms. If you can trade them in the real world, you can exchange them for a lot of money!<br><br>\u25a0 Establish an outpost! In this dangerous world, brave wanderers are needed to establish outposts, so that tired people can have a place to rest!<br><br>\u25a0 Numerous levels! Each floor in the backrooms is very different, relax and explore the places you want to go to!<br><br>Thank you for playing!</h2>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Like building and survival \uff1f Buy this! We are going to build and survive in Backrooms!<br><br>The backrooms is a world of terror, danger, and charming, but none of these can stop people's thirst for benefits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/400b6f5bbe96a826e0f1ae9093557414.poster.avif?t=1749455662\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/400b6f5bbe96a826e0f1ae9093557414.webm?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/400b6f5bbe96a826e0f1ae9093557414.mp4?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Since Backrooms became known to the world, within a year, a large number of companies, groups, and wanderers have been seeking opportunities to enter the Backrooms, searching for treasures, occupying land, and obtaining huge profits!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/68933bc5ba664ef3d358b669140e34b4.poster.avif?t=1749455662\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/68933bc5ba664ef3d358b669140e34b4.webm?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/68933bc5ba664ef3d358b669140e34b4.mp4?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The player is an individual wanderer, entering the back room through the emerging company - Wanderer Union Limited. In the midst of mystery and danger, they collect supplies, establish outposts, and earn profits!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/97b3fb2da9f8d02e5ceac7710d45108d.poster.avif?t=1749455662\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/97b3fb2da9f8d02e5ceac7710d45108d.webm?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2865130/extras/97b3fb2da9f8d02e5ceac7710d45108d.mp4?t=1749455662\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game elements:<br><br>\u25a0 Free exploration! Explore and discover interesting things freely in the multi-layered open world of the backrooms!<br><br>\u25a0 Collect materials! There are many interesting garbage and treasures in the backrooms. If you can trade them in the real world, you can exchange them for a lot of money!<br><br>\u25a0 Establish an outpost! In this dangerous world, brave wanderers are needed to establish outposts, so that tired people can have a place to rest!<br><br>\u25a0 Numerous levels! Each floor in the backrooms is very different, relax and explore the places you want to go to!<br><br>Thank you for playing!</h2>",
